 "c": [
  {"i":1827,"t":["health"],"s":{"1":["science"]},"n":"Fever is the core learner sense; heat as a physical quantity (熱を加える, 熱が伝わる) is science. Weather uses 暑い/気温, not 熱."},
  {"i":1830,"t":["family","plants"],"s":{"2":["school"]},"n":"子供を育てる and 花を育てる are both the basic 'raise' sense, so plants belongs in t. The 'train/educate' sense (人材を育てる) goes to school."},
  {"i":1949,"t":["qualities"],"n":"Learners meet 面 as aspect or surface (この面では, 表面). 'Face' read as めん is rare; they learn 顔, so the body sense is dropped."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":1801,"keep":[],"n":"'Exceed' is a general comparison sense, more often written 超える; it would not be taught in a numbers unit."},
  {"i":1817,"keep":[2],"n":"適当な人 (sloppy, irresponsible) is a very common everyday description of personality."},
  {"i":1819,"keep":[2],"n":"経済成長 and company growth are standard learner vocabulary in the economy unit."},
  {"i":1827,"keep":[1],"n":"Heat as a physical phenomenon (太陽の熱, 熱を加える) is common and fits the science unit, apart from fever."},
  {"i":1830,"keep":[],"n":"Training or educating people (後輩を育てる) is an extension of raising and is not school vocabulary; family covers it."},
  {"i":1838,"keep":[2],"n":"お客さん as shop customer is one of the most common senses and is core to shopping."},
  {"i":1843,"keep":[3],"n":"Learners meet 変化 when talking about verb and adjective forms in grammar lessons."},
  {"i":1849,"keep":[3],"n":"Role in a play or film (主役, 役を演じる) is common and belongs to arts."},
  {"i":1856,"keep":[2],"n":"'Opposite' (反対の意味, 反対側) is a very common sense, distinct from objecting."},
  {"i":1862,"keep":[5],"n":"答えを当てる (guess right) is a common learner sense that belongs to thinking."},
  {"i":1863,"keep":[],"n":"戦い for a match is mainly journalistic; sports units teach 試合 instead."},
  {"i":1864,"keep":[2,5],"n":"部 as school club (部活, サッカー部) and as a counter for copies (一部, 二部) are both common at this level."},
  {"i":1879,"keep":[],"n":"'Mistake' is normally 間違い; this sense of 違い is uncommon for learners."},
  {"i":1882,"keep":[],"n":"Learners meet 作戦 mostly as 'plan or strategy'; the military-operation sense is not taught in a law or military unit."},
  {"i":1883,"keep":[2],"n":"Holding on (つり革につかまる, 手すりにつかまる) is a common everyday physical action."},
  {"i":1884,"keep":[4],"n":"Episode (最終回, 次回) is common in TV and media contexts; baseball innings are too specialised to teach in sports."},
  {"i":1891,"keep":[3],"n":"考えが浮かぶ and 頭に浮かぶ are very common and belong to thinking."},
  {"i":1902,"keep":[1],"n":"事件の現場, the scene of a crime or accident, is a common news and police sense."},
  {"i":1903,"keep":[],"n":"Credit in the financial sense is specialised at this level; trust is the learner sense."},
  {"i":1907,"keep":[],"n":"Learners meet 構う almost only in かまわない; 'look after or keep company' is less common at N3."},
  {"i":1932,"keep":[],"n":"A prayer or wish at a shrine is still a wish, so 't' already covers it; no separate culture unit is needed."},
  {"i":1942,"keep":[3],"n":"車を飛ばす (drive fast) is a common colloquial transport expression."}
 ]
